# Google Cloud Vision / Translation authenticate via Application Default
# Credentials (ADC) by default -- run these once per machine, no file needed:
#   gcloud auth application-default login
#   gcloud config set project handheld-ocr-translator
#
# Note: the backend code does not currently read a .env file or these
# variables -- this file just documents the ADC setup above. Only set this
# if you switch to a service-account key file instead of ADC, and wire up
# `GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS` (read automatically by the Google Cloud
# client libraries, no code change needed).
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/service-account.json

